{%- comment -%}
  Icon placeholder.

  The static site and this theme both use the same pattern: markup writes
  <i data-icon="name"></i> and assets/site.js swaps it for an inline SVG on load
  (MZ.ui.hydrateIcons(root) for markup injected after boot).

  Usage:
    {% render 'icon', name: 'bars' %}
    {% render 'icon', name: 'cart', class: 'cart-icon' %}

  Names defined in assets/site.js (ICONS):
    home tags wrench info users envelope bars times check arrow-right
    arrow-up-right chevron-down plus gauge stopwatch signal shield shield-half
    lock undo book headset download infinity external broom cookie copy cart
    bolt crown star discord youtube tiktok instagram twitch kick
    aff-account aff-share aff-earn
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if name != blank -%}<i data-icon="{{ name }}"{% if class != blank %} class="{{ class }}"{% endif %}></i>{%- endif -%}
